&lt;h2 id=&#34;features&#34;&gt;Features
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💻 choose a &lt;strong&gt;network adapter&lt;/strong&gt; of your PC to inspect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏷️ select a set of &lt;strong&gt;filters&lt;/strong&gt; to apply to the observed traffic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📖 view overall &lt;strong&gt;statistics&lt;/strong&gt; about your Internet traffic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📈 view &lt;strong&gt;real-time charts&lt;/strong&gt; about traffic intensity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📌 keep an eye on your network even when the application is &lt;strong&gt;minimized&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📁 &lt;strong&gt;import&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;export&lt;/strong&gt; comprehensive capture reports as &lt;strong&gt;PCAP files&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔎 identify &lt;strong&gt;6000+ upper layer services&lt;/strong&gt;, protocols, trojans, and worms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌐 find out &lt;strong&gt;domain name&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;ASN&lt;/strong&gt; of the hosts you are exchanging traffic with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏠 identify connections in your &lt;strong&gt;local network&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌍 discover the &lt;strong&gt;geographical location&lt;/strong&gt; of remote hosts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⭐ save your &lt;strong&gt;favorite&lt;/strong&gt; network hosts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🕵️‍♂️ search and &lt;strong&gt;inspect&lt;/strong&gt; each of your network connections in real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔉 set custom &lt;strong&gt;notifications&lt;/strong&gt; to inform you when defined network events occur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎨 choose the &lt;strong&gt;style&lt;/strong&gt; that fits you the most, including custom themes support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;hellip;and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;user-manual&#34;&gt;User manual
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Do you want to &lt;strong&gt;learn more&lt;/strong&gt;? &lt;br&gt;
Check out the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/GyulyVGC/sniffnet/wiki&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sniffnet Wiki&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, a comprehensive manual to help you
thoroughly master the application from a basic setup to the most advanced functionalities. &lt;br&gt;
The Wiki includes step-by-step guides, tips, examples of usage, and answers to frequent questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/GyulyVGC/sniffnet/wiki&#34;&gt;
&lt;img alt=&#34;&#34; title=&#34;Sniffnet Wiki&#34; src=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GyulyVGC/sniffnet/main/resources/logos/wiki/wikilogo.svg&#34; width=&#34;300px&#34;/&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;troubleshooting&#34;&gt;Troubleshooting
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;details&gt;
  &lt;summary&gt;See details&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;missing-dependencies&#34;&gt;Missing dependencies
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Most of the errors that may arise are likely due to your system missing dependencies
required to correctly analyze a network adapter. &lt;br&gt;
Check the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/GyulyVGC/sniffnet/wiki/Required-dependencies&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;required dependencies page&lt;/a&gt;
for instructions on how to proceed depending on your operating system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;rendering-problems&#34;&gt;Rendering problems
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;In some circumstances, especially if you are running on an old architecture or your graphical drivers are not updated,
the &lt;code&gt;wgpu&lt;/code&gt; default renderer used by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/iced-rs/iced&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;iced&lt;/a&gt;
may manifest bugs (the interface glitches, color gradients are unsupported, or some icons are completely black). &lt;br&gt;
In these cases you can set an environment variable to switch to the &lt;code&gt;tiny-skia&lt;/code&gt; renderer,
a CPU-only software renderer that should work properly on every environment:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;ICED_BACKEND&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;tiny-skia
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;in-any-case-don&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In any case, don&amp;rsquo;t hesitate to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/GyulyVGC/sniffnet/issues/new/choose&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;open an issue&lt;/a&gt;, and I will do my best to help you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;acknowledgements&#34;&gt;Acknowledgements
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A big shout-out to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/GyulyVGC/sniffnet/blob/main/CONTRIBUTORS.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;all the contributors&lt;/a&gt; of Sniffnet!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The graphical user interface has been realized with &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/iced-rs/iced&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;iced&lt;/a&gt;, a cross-platform GUI library for Rust focused on simplicity and type-safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IP geolocation and ASN data are provided by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.maxmind.com&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;MaxMind&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Last but not least, thanks to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/GyulyVGC/sniffnet/stargazers&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;every single stargazer&lt;/a&gt;: all forms of support made it possible to keep improving Sniffnet!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;stay-in-the-loop&#34;&gt;Stay in the loop
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wait&amp;hellip; there&amp;rsquo;s more!&lt;br&gt;Sniffnet is rapidly evolving, and new features are added on a regular basis.&lt;br&gt;
Follow the &lt;a href=&#34;https://sniffnet.net/news&#34;&gt;&lt;b&gt;news&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and Sniffnet socials to never miss an update.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;https://bsky.app/profile/sniffnet.net&#34;&gt;&lt;img width=&#34;48&#34; height=&#34;48&#34; alt=&#34;Bluesky&#34; title=&#34;Bluesky&#34; src=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GyulyVGC/sniffnet/main/resources/repository/badges/bluesky.svg&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;
